# Third-Party Licenses

This project is a clean-room implementation and contains no code from
Excalidraw or tldraw. The following MIT-licensed libraries are (or will be)
used at runtime; their license texts ship with the packages in node_modules
and are reproduced in distribution bundles as required.

| Library | License | Purpose | Status |
|---|---|---|---|
| roughjs | MIT | Hand-drawn/sketchy shape rendering | in use |
| perfect-freehand | MIT | Pressure-sensitive freehand ink strokes | in use |
| fractional-indexing | CC0 | Stable ordering keys for element z-index | in use |

Update this file whenever a runtime dependency is added or removed.
